# AGENTS.md — `tests/`

Root [`../AGENTS.md`](../AGENTS.md) applies.

- Keep fixtures synthetic, minimal, deterministic, and clearly labelled.
- Test observable contracts, including failure behavior; do not weaken or delete
  a gate merely to make a change pass.
- Never read a developer's real `data/raw/`, `.env`, ELN, or Lab Tracker records
  from the default test suite.
- Tests may create temporary artifacts only under test-managed temporary
  directories and must clean them up. Do not leave generated files in canonical
  project directories after completion.
- A changed public function, data schema, canonical path, or durable mutation
  protocol needs corresponding tests.
